   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 🩺 第十五天 · pandas merge 合并 + 缺失值处理\n",
    "\n",
    "**今天目标（约 1.5 小时）**：学会把两张表「按姓名对齐」合并成一张，并处理缺失数据。这是真实数据工作每天都会遇到的事。\n",
    "\n",
    "> 昨日回顾：筛选、排序、分组。今天补齐 pandas 最后两个高频技能：**合并**和**缺失值**。\n",
    ">\n",
    "> ⚠️ 先 **Kernel → Restart Kernel**。\n",
    ">\n",
    "> 数据：`patients_base.csv`（8 人基本信息）+ `patients_labs.csv`（6 人检验结果，含缺失值）。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "\n",
    "base = pd.read_csv(\"patients_base.csv\")\n",
    "labs = pd.read_csv(\"patients_labs.csv\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"基本信息表:\")\n",
    "print(base)\n",
    "print(\"\\n检验结果表:\")\n",
    "print(labs)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. merge：像 Excel 的 VLOOKUP 一样对齐两张表\n",
    "\n",
    "`pd.merge(左表, 右表, on=\"对齐用的列\", how=\"方式\")`\n",
    "\n",
    "`how` 四种方式（先只记前两种）：\n",
    "- `\"inner\"`：只保留**两边都有的**人（交集）\n",
    "- `\"left\"`：保留左表**所有人**，右边对不上的填空（最常用！）"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# inner：两边都有的人 → 郑强(只在labs)、钱进/周杰/吴芳(只在base)都会消失\n",
    "merged_inner = pd.merge(base, labs, on=\"姓名\", how=\"inner\")\n",
    "merged_inner"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# left：保留 base 所有人，labs 里没有的补成 NaN\n",
    "merged_left = pd.merge(base, labs, on=\"姓名\", how=\"left\")\n",
    "merged_left"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "**结论**：`inner` = 只留交集；`left` = 左表为主（"患者都要在，缺检验就是缺检验"）。\n",
    "\n",
    "（另外两种：`right` = 右表为主；`outer` = 两边全留。用到再查。）"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. 缺失值：先查，再处理\n",
    "\n",
    "### 2.1 查缺失：isnull / isna"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "print(\"每列有多少缺失值：\")\n",
    "print(merged_left.isnull().sum())     # 每列缺失计数"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "merged_left[merged_left[\"WBC\"].isnull()]    # 挑出 WBC 缺失的行"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 2.2 处理缺失：dropna 删 / fillna 填\n",
    "\n",
    "三种常用策略：① 删除有缺失的行；② 用均值/中位数填；③ 用指定值填（如填\"未测\"）。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ① 删掉任何一列有缺失的行\n",
    "merged_left.dropna()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ② 用每列的均值填充（医学数据常用）\n",
    "filled = merged_left.copy()\n",
    "filled[\"WBC\"] = filled[\"WBC\"].fillna(filled[\"WBC\"].mean())\n",
    "filled[\"血糖\"] = filled[\"血糖\"].fillna(filled[\"血糖\"].mean())\n",
    "filled"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# ③ 用指定值填（比如性别缺失填\"未知\"）\n",
    "merged_left[\"性别\"] = merged_left[\"性别\"].fillna(\"未知\")\n",
    "merged_left.head()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
