   "source": [
    "## 📌 今日小抄\n",
    "\n",
    "合并：`pd.merge(左, 右, on=\"键列\", how=\"inner/left/right/outer\")`\n",
    "\n",
    "inner = 两边都有 ｜ left = 左表为主 ｜ outer = 全保留\n",
    "\n",
    "查缺失：`df.isnull()` / `df.isnull().sum()`\n",
    "\n",
    "删缺失行：`df.dropna()`\n",
    "\n",
    "填缺失：`df[\"列\"].fillna(值)` ｜ 填均值 `fillna(df[\"列\"].mean())`\n",
    "\n",
    "改原表先 `copy()`：`filled = df.copy()`"
   ]
  }
